STATES (every non-gated one renders — no hidden surface)
  gated    → engine disabled / status unresolved → the whole surface is withdrawn (EmptyView), reproducing web
             `!status?.enabled → null`. NOT a hidden section: when enabled but no vehicles, the empty state shows.
  loading  → skeleton metric grid + bar + two vehicle rows (P4 leaf; the web mounts nothing while the first fetch
             is in flight — the leaf shows chrome instead of a flash of nothing).
  empty    → "No vehicles tracked yet. …" with a friendly icon (web enabled with no savings + no vehicles), never
             a blank box. The savings-present + no-vehicles case renders savings + the same note inline.
  error    → retryable error chrome (P4 leaf addition; the web has no error branch).
  data     → SavingsCard (4 metrics + breakdown bar + legend) + the VehicleActivity rows with expandable detail.
  stale    → header chip + banner + one-shot auto-refresh on the live→stale transition.
  offline  → header chip + banner over last-known content; no auto-refresh.

